{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"木匠耶沙米尔","text":"[show]哈？格雷姆，你不是渔夫吗？怎么连保存鱼的方法都不知道？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"渔民格雷米","text":"[show]这个……我是渔夫，我只会捉鱼……至于怎么保存鱼这类的问题，我还没考虑过……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"木匠耶沙米尔","text":"[show]哼……现在的年轻人啊……罢了罢了，你捕鱼才没几年，有些事情不知道也是正常的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"木匠耶沙米尔","text":"[show]让我来告诉你吧，我们老一辈人都会做一种风干架，把鱼挂在上面风干，就能延长食物的保质期。如果有多余的鱼，就放到风干架上保存吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"木匠耶沙米尔","text":"[show]不过最近渔获情况都不是很好，路边的风干架确实少了……不知道也情有可原。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"渔民格雷米","text":"[show]还真有！那太好了——！请务必教教我怎么制作！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我也想学怎么做这个风干架！说不定到时候还能在营地用上呢。需要准备什么吗？我们去给你们带过来！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"木匠耶沙米尔","text":"[show]嗯……那就帮我带[color=f1401c] 3 个木板[colorEnd]和[color=f1401c] 1 个石砖[colorEnd]，这些就够了。我制作的时候，你们可要看清喽。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好的，我们这就去把材料准备好！格雷米，你也动起来！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":-500,"trans":true,"y":-125,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1.5,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"与尾指村的耶沙米尔【c3_area1_5】聊聊关于鱼的事情。","script":"s_3_12_1"}